# Bare patterns in .dockerignore only match at the build-context root (unlike
# .gitignore), so directories nested one level down — backend/.venv,
# frontend/node_modules, backend/data — need an explicit **/ prefix to be
# excluded. Without it they get sent to the daemon and copied into the image.
**/data/
.env
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/docs/
.git/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
frontend/dist/
